Position demo at x 1450 (right side). For title, overlay gradient is dark on left, so actors on right visible. Camera centered around 1400. Player x=1320 facing right; enemy x=1450 facing left. They spar. Add third enemy further right.

Menu update: every 1.4-2.2s choose actor, set attack = pick([punch1, punch2]) and state='attack', attackTime=0, facing other. Add a hit spark at midpoint with no damage for visual flair. Cool. But if both attack overlapping, fine.

