But when returning to menu after a game (toMenu), bootAt is old, so it renders immediately (menuSceneShown false → now-bootAt >=1600 true). Good, and canvas unhidden.

At boot, canvas hidden → set class before first frame? Add class in HTML: `<canvas id="game" class="is-veiled">`. CSS `.is-veiled{visibility:hidden}`. Then main.js removes when shown.

